  "prefLabel": "Geo 401.02 Renewal of License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 401.02 Renewal of License. Any licensee wishing to renew a license shall submit:\n\n(a) The renewal application supplied by the board;\n\n(b) The fee specified in Geo 305.02 (e); and\n\n(c) The late fee of 20 percent per month if the renewal is not received by the date of expiration.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss by #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/geo100-500.html"
